--- Numeric Comparisons ---
10 < 20: true
20 <= 20: true
30 > 15: true
15 >= 15: true
-5 < 0: true
3.14 > 2.71: true
--- Numeric Boundary and False Conditions ---
20 < 10: false
25 <= 20: false
10 > 30: false
10 >= 15: false
--- Equality and Inequality ---
10 == 10: true
10 != 20: true
'abc' == 'abc': true
'abc' != 'xyz': true
nil == nil: true
true != false: true
[1, 2] == [1, 2]: true
--- Non-Numeric Relational Comparisons (SVM Fallback Behavior) ---
'a' < 'b': false
'b' > 'a': false
true < false: false
nil < 0: false
[1] < [2]: false
--- Mixed Type Equality ---
10 == '10': false
0 == false: false
nil == false: false